// "Ruban Réglisse": a liquorice ribbon through the pastry land (issue #78, the anti-gravity's
// circuit), redrawn after the guide « Conception des circuits » (issue #151, docs/GAME_DESIGN.md
// § 16; Max, 2026-10-20: « on ne coupe rien », its three zones keep their length). Original
// layout, about 2080 m a lap, turning right, from 12 to 22 m up: the start straight,
// north; the S of the toffee (two hairpins of 180° back to back, right then left, climbing); the
// risky jump's corner on the top, 22 m up (a tight corner to the right, its inside a drop that a
// ramp crosses), its wide landing, east; a drop of 5 m and a bump down to the embankment; the
// wall (issue #78), the north-east turn, the banked turn (issue #96), the hairpin of issue #94
// and the ceiling (issue #94), as they were; out of the ceiling, the hairpins of the cake (left,
// then right, back to back); the bulge round a giant lollipop, whose hidden road runs straight
// behind a stack of crates; the last corner, that the grass bridge crosses behind a panel that
// breaks under a boost; a bump on the way back to the line. Five hairpins of 180° (a Normal bot
// drifts them), the bulge's S, two tight corners of 90°: no long soft curve but in the zones,
// one long straight. The pieces of the shortcuts (the jump's corner and its landing; the
// bulge, the last corner, their paths and the start straight) are the Bourg Bouillotte's (the
// Coteau Citrouille's, the Corniche Cannelle's, issues #107, #156: their gains and their hiding
// were tuned), with their covers; the three zones and their turns are the old Ruban's; the rest
// is new. Drawn as a plan of straights and arcs, its points every 8 m along it (25 m in the
// zones, as before; the parameters below follow them). The generator is not in the repository.
//
// Format: see src/track/data.rs. Point 0 is the start line; karts drive toward point 1 (north,
// -Z), then turn right. The grid sits on the straight behind point 0.
(
    name: "Ruban Réglisse",
    // Dressing (issue #11): the pastry land (`assets/data/biomes.ron`), the same every time
    // (seed), and pieces placed by hand: gingerbread men at the start line; a giant cupcake by
    // the jump's corner; the giant cake in the infield, under the ribbon; a giant lollipop in
    // the bulge.
    biome: "Guimauve",
    // Issue #187: its own road, of shiny liquorice (its ribbon), sweets along it; the anti-gravity
    // zones keep their blue and white curbs and stripes.
    road: (paving: Licorice, border: Candies, asphalt: (0.30, 0.20, 0.32),
           curbs: ((0.98, 0.55, 0.75), (0.99, 0.96, 0.90))),
    // Issue #104: its music (`assets/data/music.ron`).
    music: "fever-stadium",
    decor_seed: 78,
    // Issue #195: the pastry land's terrain (its biome's, `assets/data/biomes.ron`), as before:
    // the ribbon, 12 to 22 m above the pink fields, stands on its skirts (around the zones that
    // bank, a terrain that hugs the road stays flat anyway, and most of the ribbon is there).
    props: [
        (model: "holiday-kit/gingerbread-man", at: 0.0, side: Both, height: 3.5, radius: 1.2, gap: 1.8),
        // A giant cupcake by the jump's corner, over the drop.
        (model: "food-kit/cupcake", at: 36.204, side: Left, height: 12.0, radius: 6.0, gap: 2.0),
        // The giant cake of the old Ruban, in the infield.
        (model: "food-kit/cake-birthday", at: 71.500, side: Right, height: 5.0, radius: 6.5, gap: 18.0),
        // A giant lollipop in the bulge.
        (model: "food-kit/lollypop", at: 134.216, side: Right, height: 24.0, radius: 3.8, gap: 8.0),
    ],
    checkpoint_spacing: 25.0,
    points: [
        (pos: (0.00, 12.00, 0.00), width: 15.0, shoulder: 3.0),
