         ramp_length: 8.0, ramp_angle: 12.0,
         points: [(89.49, 22.00, -122.88), (91.48, 22.00, -137.89), (99.00, 22.00, -142.83), (124.99, 21.58, -159.89), (133.99, 21.58, -159.89)]),
        // Issue #193: grass, like every shortcut: it pays only with a boost.
        // The hidden road: narrow (5 m), straight behind the giant lollipop while the road goes
        // round it, behind a stack of crates 18 m in, where it leaves the road's edge (they burst
